**Purpose**: Set filesystem group ID

**Signature**:
```c
int brix_plat_setfsgid(gid_t gid);
```

**Parameters**:
- `gid`: Group ID

**Returns**: `0` on success, `-1` on error

| Platform | Implementation | Performance |
|----------|---------------|-------------|
| **Linux** | `setfsgid()` | O(1), syscall |
| **macOS** | `setegid()` | O(1), syscall |
| **Windows** | Stub (returns `0`) | O(1), no-op |

**Example**:
```c
if (brix_plat_setfsgid(cache_gid) < 0) {
    ngx_log_error(NGX_LOG_ERR, "Failed to set filesystem GID");
