**Purpose**: Remove extended attribute

**Signature**:
```c
int brix_plat_removexattr(const char *path, const char *name);
```

**Returns**: `0` on success, `-1` on error

| Platform | Implementation | Performance |
|----------|---------------|-------------|
| **Linux** | `removexattr(path, name)` | O(1), syscall |
| **macOS** | `removexattr(path, name)` | O(1), syscall |
| **Windows** | NTFS ADS: `DeleteFileW()` on stream | O(1), API call |

**Example**:
