```

---

### 8.6 `brix_plat_fremovexattr()`

**Purpose**: Remove extended attribute (file descriptor version)

**Signature**:
```c
int brix_plat_fremovexattr(int fd, const char *name);
```

**Returns**: `0` on success, `-1` on error

| Platform | Implementation | Performance |
|----------|---------------|-------------|
| **Linux** | `fremovexattr(fd, name)` | O(1), syscall |
| **macOS** | `fremovexattr(fd, name)` | O(1), syscall |
