**Purpose**: List extended attributes (file descriptor version)

**Signature**:
```c
ssize_t brix_plat_flistxattr(int fd, char *list, size_t size);
```

**Returns**: Bytes written, or `-1` on error

| Platform | Implementation | Performance |
|----------|---------------|-------------|
| **Linux** | `flistxattr(fd, list, size)` | O(n), syscall |
| **macOS** | `flistxattr(fd, list, size, 0, 0)` | O(n), syscall |
| **Windows** | Convert fd to path + `brix_plat_listxattr()` | O(n), API calls |

